  "dct_description_sm": [
    "The broader objectives of the early years of this project (1979-1992) were to describe the major biotic communities, and to study the environmental factors that influence plant and animal diversity and productivity of the oasis, located in a landscape otherwise characterized by barren polar desert and glaciers. The primary objective of the later years of this project (1992-present) was to document the responses of High Arctic plant ecosystems to climate change, particularly regional warming."
